<!--
     Deliberately empty for this phase: boot/health/fastboot/power/
     keymint/gatekeeper each ship their own VINTF fragment alongside
     their init.rc (via their Android.bp vintf_fragments), so this
     device-level manifest doesn't need to redeclare them. There is no
     device-specific HAL requiring manual declaration yet (no camera,
     no wifi/bluetooth, no display/GPU) - add one here the way K1 does
     for its external USB camera HAL once A210 has an equivalent.
-->
